    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "🐪 A river trader walks into Haven a day early — word of the village's standing travels faster than feet. \"Heard Haven's name on the river,\" they say, pack heavy, smile practiced. \"Thought I'd see it for myself.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 9,
      "line": "💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Lockpick: Buy it off. It steals FIRST and fights second — but it CANNOT resist food. OFFER FOOD in the fight: it drops your things mid-scamper for the meal. A bribe is cheaper than a chase. (You lived to tell it — twice — and now you see the pattern.)"
    },
    {
